[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3213188697","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109855#issuecomment-3213188697","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109855","id":3213188697,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_hV5Z","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-22T06:24:16Z","updated_at":"2025-08-22T06:35:39Z","body":"~~Hmmm, this may have been a caching issue, after another restart it went away. Let me test some more...~~\n\nNope, it is definitely reproducible, but it looks like when you do something extra (haven't figured out what yet) that triggers shaders to recompile, then things get fixed.\nCreating a new project however...\n\nSo my guess is that we broke the logic that trigger shader re-compilation when our settings change.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3213188697/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"