pos/godotengine/godot/issues/109855","id":3213344098,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_h71i","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-22T07:21:04Z","updated_at":"2025-08-22T07:21:04Z","body":"Most likely all the way back to the shader baker, this revert only removes baking of some macOS specific variants.\n\nOr it is unrelated at all, make sure to wipe the editor shader cache on each bisect iteration, it might be loading the wrong cached version because of baking changes.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3213344098/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3213383729","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109855#issuecomment-3213383729","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109855","id":3213383729,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_iFgx","user":{"login":"precup","id":709680,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTY4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/709680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup","html_url":"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-22T07:34:41Z","updated_at":"2025-08-22T07:34:41Z","body":"At every stage of the bisect, I deleted the entire project folder and made a new project from scratch. There's not some global cache I need to clear, as well, right? My general steps are:\n- Delete the project folder\n- Create a new project at that location\n- Switch it to Mobile\n- Enable XR shaders and restart\n- See if there's error spam in the console or not\n\nI've just reconfirmed again that there are no errors on the parent commit and that there are errors on the commit in that PR:\n\n```\n(venv) [00:12] arch@freshmaster:~/Dev/godot_manager (main)$ rm -r projects/xr3\n(venv) [00:26] arch@freshmaster:~/Dev/godot_manager (main)$ ./bimon.py run e0603aeda3ce0e15c5843f5202172a56f3ff5534 xr3\nCould not find a project named xr3.\nCreate one now? [y/N]: y\nLaunching commit e0603aeda3...\nCommand: /home/arch/Dev/godot_manager/versions/e0603aeda3ce0e15c5843f5202172a56f3ff5534/bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64.llvm -e\nWorking directory: projects/xr3/\n┌─godot──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\nGodot Engine v4.5.beta.custom_build.e0603aeda (2025-07-23 18:27:12 UTC) - https://godotengine.org\nVulkan 1.4.303 - Forward+ - Using Device #0: NVIDIA - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2080 Ti\n\nGodot Engine v4.5.beta.custom_build.e0603aeda (2025-07-23 18:27:12 UTC) - https://godotengine.org\nVulkan 1.4.303 - Forward Mobile - Using Device #0: NVIDIA - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2080 Ti\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n(venv) [00:27] arch@freshmaster:~/Dev/godot_manager (main)$ rm -r projects/xr3\n(venv) [00:27] arch@freshmaster:~/Dev/godot_manager (main)$ ./bimon.py run 9c325d0f91 xr3\nCould not find a project named xr3.\nCreate one now? [y/N]: y\nLaunching commit 9c325d0f91...\nCommand: /home/arch/Dev/godot_manager/versions/9c325d0f911e7c4c4f142177f124f3f70b3666ce/bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64.llvm -e\nWorking directory: projects/xr3/\n┌─godot──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\nGodot Engine v4.5.beta.custom_build.9c325d0f9 (2025-07-23 20:02:43 UTC) - https://godotengine.org\nVulkan 1.4.303 - Forward+ - Using Device #0: NVIDIA - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2080 Ti\n\nGodot Engine v4.5.beta.custom_build.9c325d0f9 (2025-07-23 20:02:43 UTC) - https://godotengine.org\nVulkan 1.4.303 - Forward Mobile - Using Device #0: NVIDIA - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2080 Ti\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\nThe parent commit `e0603aeda` renders fine and has no errors, `9c325d0f9` has errors and a black 3D section.\n<img width=\"1142\" height=\"675\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/293f50b7-b2c3-460b-95af-378e51c1ba45\" />","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3213383729/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3213445903","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109855#issuecomment-3213445903","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109855","id":3213445903,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_iUsP","user":{"login":"precup","id":709680,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTY4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/709680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup","html_url":"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-22T07:56:20Z","updated_at":"2025-08-22T07:56:20Z","body":"Poking around the history some more, I've been able to get three different sets of error outputs at different points in recent history, so approaching this from a history perspective seems messy. I'm tagging out on that for tonight, at least.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3213445903/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3213451099","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109855#issuecomment-3213451099","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109855","id":3213451099,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_iV9b","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-22T07:58:11Z","updated_at":"2025-08-22T07:58:11Z","body":">  There's not some global cache I need to clear, as well, right?\n\nEditor have its own global cache, it's at:\n\n- Windows: `%APPDATA%\\Godot\\shader_cache`\n- macOS: `~/Library/Application Support/Godot/shader_cache`\n- Linux: `~/.config/godot/shader_cache`","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3213451099/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3213457164","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109855#issuecomment-3213457164","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109855","id":3213457164,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_iXcM","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-22T08:00:20Z","updated_at":"2025-08-22T08:00:20Z","body":"@bruvzg @precup that general area is what would cause this issue. It's possible that the original shader baking logic changed something that effects how this works, and reverting that code missed something that as a result changed behaviour.\n\nThe shader flag in project settings does two things:\n- it enabled `SHADER_GROUP_MULTIVIEW` or `SHADER_GROUP_ADVANCED_MULTIVIEW`, but only on Forward+, mobile doesn't use shader groups (which may be what has gone wrong here if the code changes assume shader groups are being used)\n- it enabled a number of shader variants with multiview enabled (or better said, not selecting this disables a number of variants).\n\nReally only that last one should have an effect here and I have a feeling that is where we broke something. We may simply not have reverted enough to get back to the conditions before shader baking was added.\n\nAs for the global cache, I can't rule it out fully but I could switch between two projects, one that had recompiled the shaders correctly and one that didn't, so I suspect this only effects shaders compiled for the projects cache, not for the editor cache.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3213457164/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3213458604","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109855#issuecomment-3213458604","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109855","id":3213458604,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_iXys","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-22T08:00:54Z","updated_at":"2025-08-22T08:00:54Z","body":"I would also specifically check around the following commits: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107794, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108510, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102552","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3213458604/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3213463430","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109855#issuecomment-3213463430","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109855","id":3213463430,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_iY-G","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-22T08:02:43Z","updated_at":"2025-08-22T08:03:54Z","body":"> Really only that last one should have an effect here and I have a feeling that is where we broke something. We may simply not have reverted enough to get back to the conditions before shader baking was added.\n\nThe mentioned commit only revert conditional baking of a platform specific variants added https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107794, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108510, and not any of other changes introduced by baker.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107794, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108510 additionally changed `ifdefs` to runtime conditions for MoltenVK and image atomics, these changes were not reverted.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3213463430/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3213467451","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109855#issuecomment-3213467451","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109855","id":3213467451,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_iZ87","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-22T08:04:13Z","updated_at":"2025-08-22T08:04:13Z","body":"Hmm, ok one thing I misspoke about, look like we added shader group support to the mobile renderer as part of the shader baker logic.\nMaybe that is where something went wrong?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3213467451/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3213505257","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109855#issuecomment-3213505257","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109855","id":3213505257,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_ijLp","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-22T08:17:04Z","updated_at":"2025-08-22T08:27:10Z","body":"Check if the following change does something:\n\n```diff\ndiff --git a/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shader_rd.cpp b/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shader_rd.cpp\nindex ec3ac76c36..485f82bcc7 100644\n--- a/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shader_rd.cpp\n+++ b/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shader_rd.cpp\n@@ -463,7 +463,7 @@ bool ShaderRD::_load_from_cache(Version *p_version, int p_group) {\n        for (uint32_t i = 0; i < variant_count; i++) {\n                int variant_id = group_to_variant_map[p_group][i];\n                uint32_t variant_size = f->get_32();\n-               if (!variants_enabled[variant_id] || variant_size == 0) {\n+               if (!variants_enabled[variant_id]) {\n                        continue;\n                }\n                Vector<uint8_t> variant_bytes;\n```\n\nThis is the one of the changes that was not reverted, and might have some effect on loading cache, but should not change anything for baked and new runtime checks.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3213505257/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3213588843","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109855#issuecomment-3213588843","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109855","id":3213588843,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_i3lr","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-22T08:46:58Z","updated_at":"2025-08-22T08:46:58Z","body":"@bruvzg no, that didn't make a difference for me. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3213588843/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3213604623","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109855#issuecomment-3213604623","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109855","id":3213604623,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_i7cP","user":{"login":"precup","id":709680,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTY4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/709680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup","html_url":"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-22T08:52:31Z","updated_at":"2025-08-22T08:53:08Z","body":"That doesn't change the behavior noticeably, but undoing one more line of the reversion does:\n```diff\ndiff --git a/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shader_rd.cpp b/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shader_rd.cpp\nindex ec3ac76c36..d1147d4ce2 100644\n--- a/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shader_rd.cpp\n+++ b/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shader_rd.cpp\n@@ -463,7 +463,8 @@ bool ShaderRD::_load_from_cache(Version *p_version, int p_group) {\n        for (uint32_t i = 0; i < variant_count; i++) {\n                int variant_id = group_to_variant_map[p_group][i];\n                uint32_t variant_size = f->get_32();\n-               if (!variants_enabled[variant_id] || variant_size == 0) {\n+               ERR_FAIL_COND_V(variant_size == 0 && variants_enabled[variant_id], false);\n+               if (!variants_enabled[variant_id]) {\n                        continue;\n                }\n                Vector<uint8_t> variant_bytes;\n```\n\nThis doesn't completely remove the errors, but it turns a constant error spam every time the project is opened into one batch of 7 errors printed once on first project open and then never again and fixes the rendering issues.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3213604623/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3213622794","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109855#issuecomment-3213622794","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109855","id":3213622794,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_i_4K","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_ur